{{motivation_score_summary}}

The scores summarize your answers on a scale from 1 to 5. They are not percentages, and the five scores do not need to add up to a particular total. You may be drawn to several areas, to one area, or to none of these activities at present. Your results describe this occasion and may change as you gain experience or enter a different season of life.
